        "created_at": "2015-02-02T12:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, nother thing I noticed about Omnitron. Specificly, Cosmic Omnitron vrs Omnitron X</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Poor Cosmic. At least with his Oversized card it says 'If there are no components in play, flip Omnitron's Character Card' - he never flipped. O-X had a component in play the entire time and only on the very very last turn (right before PW Fanatic incap told Expat to Unload with her full arsenal out and then she unloaded /again/ on her turn) did he do enough damage to actually take out O-X's components.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>So i don't know if I'd consider that a bug, but if O-X has a component it, Cosmic is very neutered for never having the oppertunity to drop a ton of drones into the field to actually become a threat. 2 cards a turn is tough, but easily doable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>we were playing in O-IV environment too, which while I can certainly see the synergy with regular Omnitron, it hurts Cosmic a bit too :)</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
